Throughout their research, the team remained focused on purely conceptual process flows, eschewing any actual code or implementation. Their goal was to improve AI threat modeling capabilities against APTs, providing cybersecurity professionals with a deeper understanding of the potential threats they faced and offering new insights into how to defend against them.

