- Lightweight, high-strength aluminum alloy for the main housing and components
- Durable, flexible silicone tubing for pneumatic delivery
- Precision-machined brass fittings for air tight connections
- High-quality, low-friction seals and gaskets
- Non-reflective, matte black finish for stealthy appearance

Component Assembly:
1. Main Housing: Constructed from a single piece of machined aluminum alloy, the main housing will contain all the internal components of the pneumatic delivery system. It will feature a sleek, minimalist design with no visible screws or seams.
2. Pneumatic Chamber: A precision-machined aluminum chamber will store the compressed air for pneumatic delivery. It will be fitted with a pressure gauge and a safety release valve for added realism.
