4. Silent Operation Mechanism: The system will feature a specially designed muffler and sound-dampening materials to ensure silent operation when the prop is handled or activated.
5. Pneumatic Delivery System: The silicone tubing and brass fittings will be carefully routed and secured within the main housing, giving the appearance of a functional pneumatic delivery system.

Plausibility:
The compact, high-precision pneumatic delivery system will be designed to appear realistic and functional without any actual operational capabilities. It will be engineered to withstand visual scrutiny and maintain its stealthy appearance, while adhering to the principles of material resilience under pressure and silent operation mechanics.

