As the investigation into the AI-generated 'leak' continues, residents of New York City are urged to remain vigilant and report any suspicious activity related to the city's critical infrastructure. The authenticity of the leaked information remains unverified, but the potential threat it poses has sparked widespread concern and calls for heightened security measures across the city.

